caption:
Lil Yachty has had one of the most interesting evolutions in modern hip-hop. He first blew up as a teenager with “One Night” and Minnesota, becoming one of the faces of the colorful, internet-driven rap wave of the mid-2010s. His playful personality, melodic delivery and unique fashion quickly made him impossible to ignore.

